    "chapterId": 10,
    "fileId": 36763,
    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "Chronic myeloid leukaemia (CML), chronic phase",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Bone marrow core biopsy shows hypercellularity and notable granulocytic hyperplasia with left shift and increased eosinophils (&lt;&lt;39480&gt;&gt;). Megakaryocytic hyperplasia is seen; the megakaryocytes are characteristically smaller than normal megakaryocytes (dwarf megakaryocytes) and may be relatively few in number (&lt;&lt;36763&gt;&gt;). Other cases show markedly increased dwarf megakaryocytes (&lt;&lt;36765&gt;&gt;).",
